WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.512
Verbs show actions or states. Singular and plural subjects need matching verb forms.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.929
Complete “Esi blank to school each day.” Answer: walks

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:14.730
Underline each subject and correct its verb in six sentences.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.333
Discuss why: A singular third-person subject takes walks in the simple present.
